@startuml transaction-states
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
left to right direction

state "Pending" as PENDING
state "Review required" as REVIEW : waits for an analyst
state "Approved" as APPROVED
state "Blocked" as BLOCKED

[*] --> PENDING : transaction created
PENDING --> APPROVED : score 0–39
PENDING --> REVIEW : score 40–69\nor a rule failed
PENDING --> BLOCKED : score 70–100
REVIEW --> REVIEW : replayed automated\ndecision is ignored
APPROVED --> [*]
BLOCKED --> [*]
@enduml
